{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 4,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " sons, the instruction of a father,\nAnd attend to know understanding:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I give you good doctrine;\nForsake ye not my law.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I was a son unto my father,\nTender and only beloved in the sight of my mother.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he taught me, and said unto me:\nLet thy heart retain my words;\nKeep my commandments, and live;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Get wisdom, get understanding;\nForget not, neither decline from the words of my mouth;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Forsake her not, and she will preserve thee;\nLove her, and she will keep thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wisdom ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the principal thing; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "therefore",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " get wisdom;\nYea, with all thy getting get understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Exalt her, and she will promote thee;\nShe will bring thee to honor, when thou dost embrace her.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "She will give to thy head a chaplet of grace;\nA crown of beauty will she deliver to thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear, O my son, and receive my sayings;\nAnd the years of thy life shall be many.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have taught thee in the way of wisdom;\nI have led thee in paths of uprightness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When thou goest, thy steps shall not be straitened;\nAnd if thou runnest, thou shalt not stumble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Take fast hold of instruction; let her not go:\nKeep her; for she is thy life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Enter not into the path of the wicked,\nAnd walk not in the way of evil men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Avoid it, pass not by it;\nTurn from it, and pass on.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For they sleep not, except they do evil;\nAnd their sleep is taken away, unless they cause some to fall.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For they eat the bread of wickedness,\nAnd drink the wine of violence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the path of the righteous is as the dawning light,\nThat shineth more and more unto the perfect day.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The way of the wicked is as darkness:\nThey know not at what they stumble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, attend to my words;\nIncline thine ear unto my sayings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let them not depart from thine eyes;\nKeep them in the midst of thy heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For they are life unto those that find them,\nAnd health to all their flesh.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Keep thy heart with all diligence;\nFor out of it are the issues of life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Put away from thee a wayward mouth,\nAnd perverse lips put far from thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let thine eyes look right on,\nAnd let thine eyelids look straight before thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Make level the path of thy feet,\nAnd let all thy ways be established.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.4.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Turn not to the right hand nor to the left:\nRemove thy foot from evil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
